---
import { GRAND_PRIX_FULL_SCHEDULE, type SeasonStop } from '../../data/season-stops';
import StopBentoTile from './StopBentoTile.astro';
---

<section class="season-bento-wrap" aria-labelledby="season-bento-heading">
	<header class="season-bento-intro">
		<p class="season-bento-eyebrow">Season 2026–2027 · Four tour stops + series championship</p>
		<h2 id="season-bento-heading" class="season-bento-heading">
			Where the <span class="season-bento-heading-accent">Grand Prix</span> happens
		</h2>
		<p class="season-bento-lead">
			These are full tournament weekends, not side events. Every stop runs real brackets across divisions,
			with Grand Prix points on the line and the energy of a standalone host city. Your finishes feed one
			statewide leaderboard from the May opener in Ocala through the December outdoor stop in Eustis, the last
			tour weekend on the 2026 calendar. The <strong>series championship</strong> row below is the 2027
			season finale (location and exact dates TBD, pending USA Racquetball approval). Play any or all four tour
			stops and chase the Florida Grand Prix standings all season.
		</p>
	</header>

	<div class="season-bento-creative-shell">
		<div class="season-bento season-bento--creative" aria-label="Grand Prix schedule">
			{GRAND_PRIX_FULL_SCHEDULE.map((stop) => (
				<StopBentoTile stop={stop} />
			))}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
